s variations with nifty AI. Challenging boss fights with special scripting and a story line for each of them.<br><br>More than 58 achievements.<br><br>Alarm phone calls start a mission with a unique dialogue systems that creates about 70,000 unique dialogues. On top 800 hand written crazy phone call lines for surprises and to develop the story line.<br><br>More than 350 funny context sensitive shoutouts that pop up in speech bubbles and as audio, recorded with female and male voices of professional voice actors.<br><br>Over 100 hidden references to other classical video games, movies or books are hidden as text or graphics in the game.<br><br>We have created over 90 devices of which most are actually useful in the game and a few dozen are actually pretty useless, but funny.<br><br>About 100 news messages are sent to the in-game smartphone to tell players about the story line or some absurd 100% made up stories that the player may or may not read. Also presenting 20 manufacturers of ghost hunting equipment in company profiles.<br><br>Original music score composed by Sound Of Games.<br><br>Over 100 hand crafted original sound effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background information:</h2>The developers of GhostControl Inc. are big fans of classic games such as GhostBusters, the original XCOM, Theme Hospital and FTL.<br>In it's classic pixel art retro style the game comes with outstanding original graphics and a funny story line.",
